# The Specialists page: its list, with one the project has and those
# built in; a new one's form, typed into; its agent picked from a list;
# saved; then one of the user's own open, with something wrong in a
# field, and in narrow windows.
size 1280x900
file .agents/specialists/auditor/SPECIALIST.md <<END
---
name: auditor
description: Audit security-sensitive changes
limits: read-only
---
Inspect trust boundaries and report concrete findings.
END
# The project's own load only once its folder is trusted.
keys <C-;>
type :trust $PROJECT
keys <CR>
sleep 500
keys :Settings<CR>
wait-for Appearance
keys }}}}}}
wait-for New specialist
shot specialists-list
keys a
wait-for Kept in
shot specialist-new
type reviewer
keys <CR><Tab>
type Reviews changes for bugs
keys <CR>
type After a change, before it's committed
shot specialist-typing
# Past its instructions, to the agent it runs as: a list to pick from.
keys <CR><Tab><CR>
sleep 300
shot specialist-agent
keys <Down><CR>
shot specialist-picked
keys <C-s>
wait-for Saved reviewer
shot specialist-saved
# One of the project's own, open: a limit that's no number says so.
keys k<CR>
wait-for Kept in
keys <Tab><Tab><Tab><Tab><Tab><Tab><Tab>
type soon
keys <Tab>
shot specialist-wrong
size 800x780
shot specialist-800
size 640x780
shot specialist-640
keys <Esc><Esc>
shot specialists-640
